OL,3,GNEWSA'I never enjoyed exercise at
OL,4,Aschool as I was bullied' says DJ, ahead
OL,5,Aof 400-mile bike feat
OL,6,
OL,7,FRadio presenter Owain Wyn Evans has
OL,8,Fadmitted he "never enjoyed exercise at
OL,9,Fschool" because of bullying, ahead of
OL,10,Fhis four nations biking challenge for
OL,11,FChildren in Need.
OL,13,FThe host of BBC Radio 2's Early
OL,14,FBreakfast Show is set to cycle almost
OL,15,F400 miles over five days next week,
OL,16,Fsetting off from Glasgow and finishing
OL,17,Fin Cardiff.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
